# Output: none — silent output formatter: forces % for side effects, discards all output.
#
# Concurrent contract:
# 1. Drain %emit-channel: discard all emitted values
# 2. Force %: force for side effects, write nothing
# 3. Await drain task completion
#
# The forcing of % drives the full evaluation cascade (including any emit calls),
# but nothing is written to stdout.

# 1. Drain the emit channel concurrently, discarding all values.
[drain: [task
  [loop-select [context]
    [seq [ch: %emit-channel  handler: [fn [let v] []]] []]
    identity]]]

# 2. Force % to drive the evaluation cascade (for side effects).
[if [seq? %]
  [reduce [fn [let _ x] []] [] %]
  [materialize %]]

# 3. Wait for drain to finish consuming any emits triggered during forcing.
[await drain]
